  "_comment": "Maps every legacy category (the old pseudo-tag array) to its home in the new system, so old URLs 301 rather than 404. `cat` = a taxonomy slug path, `attr` = attribute filter query params, `root` = the asset-type landing page. Multi-segment legacy URLs merge: the deepest `cat` wins and all `attr` values combine.",
